# The papers are binary and must never be touched by line-ending conversion.
#
# Without this, git treats a PDF as text on Windows and rewrites LF to CRLF on
# checkout, which corrupts the file: the byte count changes, the cross-reference
# offsets inside the document no longer point at anything, and the reader gets
# a PDF that will not parse. It warned about exactly this when they were first
# staged.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
